# Rally the Monastery, first mode: "This spell costs {2} less to cast if you've cast another spell this turn" (CR 601.2f) and "Create
# two 1/1 white Monk creature tokens with prowess". Bot1 casts both Moxen on turn 1 and plays a Plains on turn 3, so it has three mana:
# Rally at {3}{W} is out of reach, and the Moxen cast on an earlier turn do not count. Casting Memnite makes it {1}{W}: the Pearl and
# the Ruby pay exactly that (the pool is empty after) and the Plains stays untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
